WEBVTT

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:13.030
A-Awesome!

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:15.160
I've only seen pictures of this...

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.820
So it really does exist!

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.710
A-Almost!

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.340
Pathetic.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.010
As I've heard, he really <i>is</i> human trash!

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.940
You're such an idiot!

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.820
If she was smiling at you like that, she was definitely propositioning you for sex!

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:25.120
Yeah, but saving to my neural SSD comes first!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:29.830
Hold on, Shuusuke. It's okay if you didn't realise she was propositioning you,

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.880
but don't tell us you forgot to take photos.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.050
Oh.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:39.090
You're so useless! It only takes a second with a cell phone!

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.430
At your age, how could you be so sloppy?!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.340
Say whatever you want.

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:48.060
I can access the erotic and beautiful cosplay princess in my brain any time.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:50.230
Damn, I'm so jealous!

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.310
The god of erotica somehow loves that guy.

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:55.070
I'm just kidding.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.360
Let's go together...

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:58.740
...to that vending machine where
I met the princess, tonight!

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:00.360
Shuusuke!

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:06.080
You've grown, Shuusuke. There's
nothing more I can teach you.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.870
Shuusuke!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.460
Was that her?
Was that her?

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.340
Cosplay princess!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.090
What?!
What?!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:21.710
That's...

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:23.510
So she's the one, Shuusuke?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.890
Invitation to the Unknown:

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.570
Details: come and you'll know;

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:31.140
Date and time: today after school;

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.520
Place: rooftop;

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.820
Is she inviting us, too?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.430
Up to four people can join.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:40.530
Four people...

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.150
It's too good to be a coincidence.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:42.950
It's a trap!
It's a trap!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.200
It must be a coincidence.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.030
Yeah.
Yeah.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.330
The cosplay princess Shuusuke met...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:50.360
...could be some big shot.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:52.540
Do you know her, Captain?

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.880
"Invitation to the Unknown"...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.340
...really!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:12.030
I saw her first thing in the morning!

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:15.390
That's apparently how she contacts the Oracle. That's intense!

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:17.230
And I heard she's smart, too.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.940
What a pity.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:19.940
This is it!

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.650
This is definitely the girl I saw last night, Captain!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.410
Who is this person?

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.660
She's Princess Layla.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.260
She's a pretty famous cosplayer in the underground world.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:34.830
She specialises in cosplaying as hentai doujinshi characters in very suggestive costumes.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.200
This photo is probably just a teaser.

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.380
J-Just a teaser?!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.760
If she gets serious,

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.210
it'll be awesome!

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.680
I want to read the source material now!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:51.060
We might be able to see something even more awesome.

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.800
"Invitation to the Unknown".

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:59.060
We might've just been invited to an incredible world: the forbidden underworld!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.360
But why us?

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.990
Don't sweat the small stuff.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.010
When petticoats woo, breeks will... something, something...

00:05:08.010 --> 00:05:10.780
Then, we're joining in no matter what it takes!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:12.120
No objections!

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.620
Thank you for coming.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.750
You have my gratitude.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.410
Thank you for inviting us-

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:25.010
I am Princess Layla.

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:29.720
The King of Destruction is after this world.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:31.850
The King of Destruction?

00:05:39.490 --> 00:05:43.900
No one knows when, where or how it was born.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:49.450
It is only known for sure that it is
the enemy of every creature alive.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:57.670
My home planet was sucked into it and vanished.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:02.010
That is when the Oracle prophesied...

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:07.790
...that the light of hope to counter the King of Destruction will appear at the end of the universe some day.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.430
Today is that "day."

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:12.210
This planet is that "end of the universe"!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:22.730
My duty is to find, awaken and guide the Messiah who lives on this planet as human trash.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.710
You must have realised by now.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:30.070
That's right. You human trash are here as potential messiahs.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.080
May I ask you a question, Princess?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.310
What is it?

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:39.210
How did you know we're human trash?

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:41.910
I see.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:43.980
Any friend of human trash is human trash!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.920
I understand.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.800
So, what should we do?

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:53.410
Step one: the great will of the universe will test your aptitude.

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:55.590
Gather tonight in white costumes.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.310
What is this genre?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:01.900
It seems this "Underworld" is a secret members-only club.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.780
"Messiah" is probably their secret word for a member.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:09.700
Only the good-looking men and women who passed the aptitude test are allowed to join the club, right, Captain?

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:10.780
I'm itching to put my skills to the test!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.200
Still...

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.870
The Princess was really pretty.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.000
Yeah, that's it!

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.340
She told us in plain clothes and not in cosplay! It was a valuable experience!

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:25.170
It's like getting to know a sexy idol.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.000
It's like a stereotypical girl next door.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.260
That's a little different.

00:07:28.260 --> 00:07:29.800
You're being too anal, Yamashiro.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:30.800
Yeah!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:35.600
Everyone, thank Shuusuke for acting like human trash!

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:38.520
Without Shuusuke, we wouldn't have met the Princess,

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.810
and we would have died without knowing about the existence of the Underworld!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.230
Thank you, Shuusuke!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.570
Oh, you!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.110
Stop it!

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.910
Yes, five more days.

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.740
I must find the Messiah soon.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:10.720
I'd leave them alone if they were just doing their usual activities,

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.630
but what's this about a forbidden underworld?

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.390
And you're at it again.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.810
You're right on time.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.980
What's so "forbidden" about that?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.190
It's just a photo shoot.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.400
You're right on the dot, Iroha-chan.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.150
That goes for you, too.

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.120
That aside, why a photo shoot?!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.620
Even if she were nude, they could only stare at her!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.200
I think it'd actually make them frustrated since they can't do anything about it,

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:45.040
though I'm fine with the sexual frustration since
it might make him escape the bounds of reason!

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:47.100
I'm getting bitten.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:49.410
Bug spray? You sure are prepared.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.900
What will we be doing for the aptitude test?

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:00.970
Don't think. We'll face it straight on.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.550
When is she going to take off the robe, anyway?

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.730
Erotic cosplay comes first.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:08.270
Take it off! Take it off! Take it off!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.150
I can hear it.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.070
It's almost here.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:14.700
Huh?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.200
Get your clothes off!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.200
Finally!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.740
O great will of the universe, come here!

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:33.800
Th-That's so erotic!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.130
She's so flexible!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:52.860
So those are the "white costumes".

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:55.690
This light...

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:58.490
The great will of the universe is talking to us.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.910
It is not!

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:08.020
Say, isn't that...

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.380
Yeah, it looks like a clone.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:25.390
Now, let's go home!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.680
Don't touch me, Clone!

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.770
Don't look into her eyes! You'll turn to stone!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.230
You won't.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:33.230
I keep telling you to stop flicking me on the forehead!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:38.070
That level of pain is nothing. Do you know
what I have to live through every day?

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:38.740
What?

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.950
People think I'm you, and this happens all the time.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.580
Back off, you filthy scum!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.540
And you, cut it out already!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:49.540
Teleport away... Teleport away... Teleport away...

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.250
It's no good.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.920
Of course it isn't.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.130
Wait, what? I can't hear you.

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.010
Who is it?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.010
It's the Oracle, Tyrol.

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.010
Oh, it's the one who's been guiding you-

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:03.260
I mean, enough already!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.970
There's no Tyrol! There's no Oracle!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:06.970
Stop talking on the phone with your imaginary friend!

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.560
You're driving me crazy!

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.270
What is it?

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.650
Weak.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:15.770
Now is the time!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.960
So even girls like this kind of idiotic cosplay?

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:22.750
It's the end of the world.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:26.490
I'll delete everything you took in secret. No complaints, right?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:31.810
You must be quite an eccentric, chasing after that guy in briefs.

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:34.540
That was quite rude, considering
this is the first time we've met.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:39.210
Exactly! He's usually in trunks!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:43.090
If you care about him, it's in your
best interest to lend me a hand.

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:44.180
Lend you a hand?

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:45.620
I want to stop my little sister.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:48.180
What is your little sister trying to do?

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.990
She's looking for a partner...

00:11:49.990 --> 00:11:51.520
...in her own way.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.060
You mean she's looking for a boyfriend?!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:56.270
At this rate, he'll be in danger.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.150
Danger?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:01.280
I wonder what'll happen to him if
he's with my little sister all the time.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:07.350
Mantora, mantora, space people!

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.830
You'll help me, right?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.630
The older sister is Yatagai Rin; the little sister is Ran.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.690
Ran is our Princess Layla.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:27.590
As we've seen, they're identical twins, Taurus, blood type B,

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:30.140
and they are a year above us.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.490
The older sister, Rin, finds the Princess's conduct sickening,

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:34.190
and the Princess calls her older sister "Clone".

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.580
As such, the two are hostile to each other.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:37.610
Moreover, the Princess does not have a boyfriend.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:43.940
The Princess is absent today. She hasn't been home since last evening and her hiding place is unknown.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:47.370
We have no way to contact her.
All we can do is wait for our test results.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:48.430
This is frustrating.

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.620
Are you fine with this, Captain?

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:50.240
With what?

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:54.490
I've been thinking, but how did Clone-nee-san find that place?

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.670
Does she know the Princess's whereabouts?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.430
I see your point. It may be worth tracking her.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.050
Could you?

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:01.510
Leave it to me!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.780
I found Clone-nee-san!

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.680
Now, where's the Princess?

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.180
Where's the Princess?!

00:13:10.530 --> 00:13:11.970
Why are those two...

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:13.480
What's going on?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.400
My little sister concealed herself.

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.460
She ran away from home?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:18.150
No, she disappears often.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.940
And at times like this, it's most likely for the ritual.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.480
"The ritual"?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.100
I know what you mean. It's ridiculous.

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.910
I really can't deal with her.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.620
I can't hear them! What are they talking about?

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.190
If things go as usual, the ritual should be tonight.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.500
I'm planning to settle this before then, but just in case,

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.250
I'd like you two to keep an eye on your big brother.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.130
Stalking him as usual is fine.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:45.970
Clone-nee-san, how are you going to settle things?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.630
Don't call me "Clone".

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:48.990
I won't call you that any more.

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:52.180
I know what she's thinking and where she is.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.850
It must be because they're twins.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:56.000
That's not it!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.100
I'm just used to it.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.820
Have you been here since last night, Princess?

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:11.440
I can't afford to be captured before I find the Messiah.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:14.860
Fortunately, this place has meals, a shower, the internet...

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:16.540
Pretty much everything.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.350
But it's only a matter of time until Clone finds us.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:20.970
Let's hurry on to the next step.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:22.460
Then, as for the aptitude test...

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.920
You've passed!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.130
We did it!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:29.430
That annoying Clone must have sensed that and came after us.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:32.220
So, what's the next step?

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.220
The ritual of awakening.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:35.890
The ritual of awakening?

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.630
The Oracle has proclaimed:

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:42.650
"When many eyes penetrate the night,
the soul of the Messiah shall awaken."

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:45.320
What if we don't awaken?

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:50.150
Then it means I picked the wrong people,

00:14:50.150 --> 00:14:53.700
and my search for the Messiah will continue.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:55.860
It's finally time.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.880
If we pass the Princess's test tonight,

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.870
we'll be invited to the land of our dreams!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.700
But if we fall short of her expectations...

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.360
...we'll be abandoned.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:07.030
No! I don't want to be the wrong person!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.750
No matter what,

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.890
we'll go to the underworld that pushes the limits!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.050
There's no such thing.

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:16.930
Who is it?!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:19.290
Clone!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:20.440
Whatever you say.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.370
Um, sorry, but this should end pretty soon.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:27.320
So, could you just stay put for a bit?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.820
It must be the ritual of awakening.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:29.950
She found out!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:32.530
It's best for you to stay quietly at home.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.950
What do you mean?

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.950
Don't you like stockingless legs?

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.740
If you go to the ritual,

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:42.460
I will make every single girl at the school wear sports jerseys below their skirts!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.060
What did you say?!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.270
Anything but that!

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:47.500
At least... At least make them wear black pantyhose!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:49.070
Calm down. She's bluffing!

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:52.720
There's no way a student has the
power to change the school's rules!

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:55.450
She laughed!

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:59.100
She's so composed. What is the source of her power?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.640
Don't tell me...

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:01.970
Does she really have the power...

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:06.270
...to make girls wear jerseys below their skirts?!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.030
Is that woman...

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:12.650
...a student council officer?

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.370
We didn't hear about that.

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:16.490
Then, was that a bluff?

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.110
But we shouldn't speculate.

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:22.350
We can't risk stockingless legs!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.540
Tomorrow will be a new day.

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:31.040
I will go to the ritual alone, Captain.

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.800
If anything happens, just abandon me.

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:37.800
Tell her that Takahashi Shuusuke
went there of his own volition!

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:42.740
I will definitely be back with information on the underworld!

